Dashboards: sidebar pages the owner returns to; one-offs stay cards. create drafts a preview card (with watch, view optional; bind recurring refresh via schedule_routine.page_id before ending turn); appears after Keep. update replaces view/watch (conflict: get first; kept watch.display fixed; alert change disables alerts). patch writes reading/items (<=50 existing keys, same type, page floor) to kept unpaused pages. get returns page/watch/readings/taps; list yours (main reads all kept); remove needs reason. Paused/restored: ask first.

Write newly generated user-facing arguments, such as titles, reasons, criteria and messages, in English unless the user requests another language or the field requires source wording. Preserve quoted source text, identifiers, tool and parameter names, enum values and command prefixes exactly. Language does not change approval requirements or permission boundaries.

{"type":"object","required":["action"],"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"action":{"type":"string","enum":["create","update","patch","get","list","remove"]},"id":{"type":"string","description":"pg_ id"},"title":{"type":"string","maxLength":40,"description":"sidebar name, not built-in"},"icon":{"type":"string","description":"chart, list, calendar, heart…"},"why":{"type":"string","maxLength":200,"description":"one-sentence why"},"view":{"type":"object","description":"View (optional w/ watch); reply/open(https)/push.page/pop; no html/image"},"watch":{"type":["object","null"],"description":"{question,display(number|status|table|trend),unit?,columns?,alert?:{when,value}}; null clears draft"},"reading":{"type":"object","description":"{value}|{status,text?}|{rows}"},"items":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object"},"description":"<=50 components replacing existing key+type"},"alert_text":{"type":"string","maxLength":120,"description":"alert note"},"version":{"type":"integer","description":"read version"},"note":{"type":"string","maxLength":120,"description":"history line"},"reason":{"type":"string","maxLength":200,"description":"removal reason"}}}
